 padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Gratuita (Nascidos 2009 e 2010):<\/strong> 0,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 08\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Sub-16 Iniciados (2 km)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 13 de Dezembro de 2026 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 16:30<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Gratuita (Nascidos 2011 e 2012):<\/strong> 0,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 08\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Sub-14 Infantis (1,2 km)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 13 de Dezembro de 2026 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 16:15<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Gratuita (Nascidos 2013 e 2014):<\/strong> 0,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 08\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Benjamins (400 m)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 13 de Dezembro de 2026 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 16:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Gratuita (Nascidos 2015 a 2019):<\/strong> 0,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 08\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada Pedestre (3 km)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 13 de Dezembro de 2026 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 15:00 \u2022 70m D+<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Gratuita (Aberta a todos):<\/strong> 0,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 08\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data, os hor\u00e1rios e o local de partida da S\u00e3o Silvestre da Guarda 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 3\u00aa S\u00e3o Silvestre da Guarda (48\u00ba Grande Pr\u00e9mio de Atletismo da Guarda) realiza-se no domingo, 13 de dezembro de 2026, com partidas e chegadas na Avenida dos Bombeiros Egitanienses (junto ao piso 3 do CC La Vie). O programa arranca \u00e0s 15:00 com a Caminhada (3 km), seguindo-se os Benjamins 400 m (16:00), Infantis 1,2 km (16:15), Iniciados 2 km (16:30), Juvenis 3 km (16:45) e a Corrida Principal de 9 km \u00e0s 17:10.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o valor da inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e o que est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 100% gratuita (0,00 \u20ac) em todas as dist\u00e2ncias e escal\u00f5es at\u00e9 \u00e0s 23:59 de 8 de dezembro de 2026, incluindo dorsal com chip, seguro desportivo, abastecimento l\u00edquido final, medalha de finisher e acesso aos balne\u00e1rios do Est\u00e1dio Municipal da Guarda. Opcionalmente, podes adquirir a t-shirt personalizada do evento por 10,00 \u20ac (para inscri\u00e7\u00f5es pagas at\u00e9 1 de dezembro).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e quando funciona o secretariado para levantamento de dorsais?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O secretariado funciona no 3\u00ba piso do Centro Comercial La Vie Guarda em dois per\u00edodos: no s\u00e1bado, 12 de dezembro, das 15:00 \u00e0s 19:00, e no domingo, dia da prova, das 10:00 \u00e0s 14:30.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como \u00e9 o percurso e que pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios est\u00e3o em disputa nos 9 km?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A volta base de 3 km (70 m D+) percorre a Av. dos Bombeiros Egitanienses, Rua Dr. Lopo de Carvalho, Rua Alves Ro\u00e7adas, Av. Alexandre Herculano, Av. Dr. Afonso Costa e Rua 31 de Janeiro (3 voltas na corrida de 9 km). A prova de 9 km distribui pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios at\u00e9 ao 30\u00ba da geral (500 \u20ac ao 1\u00ba classificado M\/F), pr\u00e9mios por escal\u00e3o\/equipas e um b\u00f3nus de 300 \u20ac para quem bater o recorde da prova. Calcula j\u00e1 o teu ritmo na nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\">Calculadora de Pace<\/a>.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem organiza a 3\u00aa S\u00e3o Silvestre da Guarda?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento \u00e9 organizado pelo Munic\u00edpio da Guarda (Divis\u00e3o de Desporto e Sa\u00fade) em parceria t\u00e9cnica com a Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo da Guarda, integrando o calend\u00e1rio de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-guarda\/\">corridas na Guarda<\/a>.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"S\u00e3o Silvestre da Guarda 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-12-13\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Avenida dos Bombeiros Egitanienses (junto ao CC La Vie), Guarda\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Guarda\", \"addressRegion\": \"Guarda\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Munic\u00edpio da Guarda e Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo da Guarda\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data, os hor\u00e1rios e o local de partida da S\u00e3o Silvestre da Guarda 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A 3\u00aa S\u00e3o Silvestre da Guarda (48\u00ba Grande Pr\u00e9mio de Atletismo da Guarda) realiza-se no domingo, 13 de dezembro de 2026, com partidas e chegadas na Avenida dos Bombeiros Egitanienses (junto ao piso 3 do CC La Vie). O programa arranca \u00e0s 15:00 com a Caminhada (3 km), seguindo-se os Benjamins 400 m (16:00), Infantis 1,2 km (16:15), Iniciados 2 km (16:30), Juvenis 3 km (16:45) e a Corrida Principal de 9 km \u00e0s 17:10.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o valor da inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e o que est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 100% gratuita (0,00 \u20ac) em todas as dist\u00e2ncias e escal\u00f5es at\u00e9 \u00e0s 23:59 de 8 de dezembro de 2026, incluindo dorsal com chip, seguro desportivo, abastecimento l\u00edquido final, medalha de finisher e acesso aos balne\u00e1rios do Est\u00e1dio Municipal da Guarda. Opcionalmente, podes adquirir a t-shirt personalizada do evento por 10,00 \u20ac (para inscri\u00e7\u00f5es pagas at\u00e9 1 de dezembro).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde e quando funciona o secretariado para levantamento de dorsais?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O secretariado funciona no 3\u00ba piso do Centro Comercial La Vie Guarda em dois per\u00edodos: no s\u00e1bado, 12 de dezembro, das 15:00 \u00e0s 19:00, e no domingo, dia da prova, das 10:00 \u00e0s 14:30.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como \u00e9 o percurso e que pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios est\u00e3o em disputa nos 9 km?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A volta base de 3 km (70 m D+) percorre a Av. dos Bombeiros Egitanienses, Rua Dr. Lopo de Carvalho, Rua Alves Ro\u00e7adas, Av. Alexandre Herculano, Av. Dr. Afonso Costa e Rua 31 de Janeiro (3 voltas na corrida de 9 km). A prova de 9 km distribui pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios at\u00e9 ao 30\u00ba da geral (500 \u20ac ao 1\u00ba classificado M\/F), pr\u00e9mios por escal\u00e3o\/equipas e um b\u00f3nus de 300 \u20ac para quem bater o recorde da prova. Calcula j\u00e1 o teu ritmo na nossa Calculadora de Pace .\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quem organiza a 3\u00aa S\u00e3o Silvestre da Guarda?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento \u00e9 organizado pelo Munic\u00edpio da Guarda (Divis\u00e3o de Desporto e Sa\u00fade) em parceria t\u00e9cnica com a Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo da Guarda, integrando o calend\u00e1rio de corridas na Guarda .\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":70073,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,27,28,478,624,47],"event_type_2":[212,726,820],"event_type_3":[744],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-48247","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-guarda","event_type-caminhada","event_type-corrida","event